9
00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:50.328
This establishes the vocabulary and scope
needed for the remaining sections.

10
00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:58.297
Now define NIST AI Risk Management Framework
Overview precisely enough that another learner

11
00:00:58.297 --> 00:01:00.712
