12
00:01:00.712 --> 00:01:08.467
The NIST AI Risk Management Framework
organizes work around Govern, Map, Measure,

13
00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:09.759
and Manage.

14
00:01:09.759 --> 00:01:17.144
Consider this worked case: In a healthcare AI
deployment, the Map phase documents the

15
00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:22.946
intended use of a diagnostic tool and
