16
00:01:22.946 --> 00:01:29.569
Separate the formal definition from an
implementation detail, then identify what

17
00:01:29.569 --> 00:01:31.978
evidence would distinguish them.

18
00:01:31.978 --> 00:01:38.696
A precise definition makes later examples
easier to evaluate and revise.

19
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:45.899
With the foundation in place, examine how
Govern Phase: Policies and Accountability

20
00:01:45.899 --> 00:01:48.853
operates in a concrete sequence.

21
00:01:48.853 --> 00:01:56.697
Govern establishes policies, responsibilities,
and accountability for AI risk.

22
00:01:56.697 --> 00:02:04.680
Consider this worked case: A university AI
ethics board assigns specific roles for

23
00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:08.978
